flowchart TD
    USER[Cashier / Operator] --> UI[Electron Desktop UI]
    UI --> BILL[Wholesale & Hawker Billing]
    UI --> STOCK[Inventory & Stock Workflows]
    UI --> REPORTS[Sales / Stock / Profit Reports]
    UI --> LEDGER[Ledger & Payments]
    BILL --> API[Node.js Application Backend]
    STOCK --> API
    REPORTS --> API
    LEDGER --> API
    API --> DB[(Local SQLite Database)]
    API --> PRINT[PDF / Thermal Printing]
    API --> BACKUP[Backup & Restore]